  "pairing": "bricolage-figtree",
  "typeCharacter": "Bricolage Grotesque in extra-bold, sentence case and tightly set echoes the chunky lowercase of the 'pregib' logo, with the hero headline at about 8vw in deep teal-ink and section heads at about 4vw. Figtree regular at 18px carries the running text and lists, and Figtree semibold handles the small labels, never uppercase or tracked.",
  "composition": "Header on the light teal tint #f1f6f4: the logo sits left, four plain text links follow, and one teal button with slightly rounded corners sits right. Hero, two rows: the headline spans columns 1–7 over three lines, with the lead below it across columns 1–5 and one teal button 'Rezervirajte termin' under that. The room photo fills columns 8–12 and bleeds off the right and top edges, with its lower-left corner cut on a diagonal. A thick orange L-shaped stroke (the logo's bent arm) is drawn in the gap between headline and photo at column 7–8, touching neither. Under the hero, a full-width deep teal #1d6a5b ribbon carries four short words in #f3faf7 Figtree semibold: manualna terapija, terapevtske vaje, dry needling, kinesio taping. Section 'V številkah' on white: four large Bricolage numerals in teal are set left-aligned in a 3+3+3+3 grid, each with a short Figtree line under it and thin #c8d8d3 vertical rules between them. Services 'S čim ljudje najpogosteje pridejo' on the tint: the heading sits in columns 1–4 and a two-column ruled list fills columns 6–12. Story 'Kako delam' on deep #0f2b27: a tall crop of the photo showing the wooden wall bars and the window with green hills sits in columns 1–5, bled left with an arched top. Running text in #e6f0ec spans columns 7–11, with a small orange bent-arm ornament above the heading. Cenik on white: a ruled table spans columns 3–10 with offering names left and durations right (60 minut, 45 minut, dodatek, paket), and no prices. Call section on the tint: the heading 'Termin si rezervirate na spletu' sits in columns 1–6 with the lead below it. Across all 12 columns runs the signature hour strip, thirteen equal teal-outlined cells from 7.00 to 20.00 labelled only at the two ends, with exactly one cell filled solid orange. One button sits beneath it. Contact 'Kje sem' on white: the address and the note 'Vhod z dvorišča, 2. nadstropje' sit in columns 1–4, with the phone as a large teal numeral and the email below. A simple schematic line map of Glavni trg in teal lines on #f1f6f4 fills columns 6–12, and the hours appear as a compact Mon–Fri list. The footer is deep #0f2b27.",
  "imagery": "The client's single photo is used twice. In the hero it appears whole, showing the treatment table, the wall bars, the blue balls and the window, cut-corner and bled to the top right. In the story section it is a tall arched crop of the wall bars and the hillside window. No other photos are used. The drawn art is the logo's bent arm rendered as a thick, round-capped orange #e07b39 L-stroke on a plain light ground, painted once large in the hero gap and once small above 'Kako delam' on the dark field. It has no letters and no figure.",
  "signature": "The hour strip: the working day from 7.00 to 20.00 laid out as thirteen equal cells across the full width, with just one filled in orange, showing that the hour belongs to one patient.",
  "copy": {
    "headline": "Ena ura je samo za enega pacienta",
    "lead": "Sem Tina Zupan, dipl. fiziot. V ambulanti na Glavnem trgu v Novem mestu delam individualno, z manualno terapijo in vajami. Napotnica ni potrebna."
  },
  "imagePrompt": "A flat full-page screenshot of a desktop homepage, 1536×1024 px, with no browser window, no device frame and no perspective, for a one-woman physiotherapy practice. The page ground is a very light cool teal tint #f1f6f4 (not cream), with sections in white #ffffff and deep teal-black #0f2b27. Text is deep teal-ink #12302b with muted #4a625d, the primary colour is teal #1d6a5b and the only accent is orange #e07b39, used only as shapes. Headings are in Bricolage Grotesque extra-bold, sentence case and tight; body text is in Figtree regular. Nothing is centred and everything is left-aligned on a 12-column grid. HEADER: the attached 'pregib fizioterapija' logo (teal figure with an orange bent arm) sits at top left, four small text links follow, and one teal button with slightly rounded corners (not pill-shaped) sits at the right. HERO: a huge three-line headline spans the left seven columns, with a short lead and one teal button beneath it. The attached photograph of the bright treatment room (grey treatment table, wooden wall bars, blue exercise balls, window with green hills) fills the right five columns, bleeding off the top and right edges, with its lower-left corner cut diagonally. Between headline and photo, a thick, round-capped orange L-shaped stroke like a bent arm sits on the plain tint ground, touching neither text nor photo. Below that runs a full-width teal #1d6a5b ribbon with four short service words in pale #f3faf7. NEXT, on a white section: four large teal numerals in a row, each with a short line of text below, separated by thin #c8d8d3 vertical rules. NEXT, on the tint: a heading on the left and a two-column list with thin horizontal rules on the right. NEXT, a deep #0f2b27 section: a tall arched crop of the same photo showing the wall bars and the hillside window, bled to the left edge. On the right sits pale #e6f0ec running text under a heading, with a small orange bent-arm stroke above it. NEXT, on white: a ruled two-column table of treatments and durations, with no prices. NEXT, on the tint: a heading and lead at left, then a full-width strip of thirteen equal rectangular cells outlined in teal, labelled 7.00 and 20.00 only at the two ends, with exactly one cell filled solid orange; one teal button sits below. NEXT, on white: the address block at left, a large teal phone numeral, and a simple schematic street map drawn in thin teal lines on a pale tint panel at right. The footer is a dark #0f2b27 band. Use flat colour only, with no gradients, no shadows, no icons, no emoji, no people and no faces."
}

